  "abstract_summary": "Every AI tool forgets a user when the session closes. Mem-Forever keeps the memory in the user's own Git repository as compact I-Lang structures that a person can read and a machine can parse, so preferences, decisions and lessons survive across sessions, tools and models. It needs no installation and no configurati...",
